Frontier HVE authored skills

The skills in this folder are original text written for Frontier HVE. Their topics and
several ideas (UX flows and states, accessibility checklist, UI content, architecture
options and ADRs, API design, low-code vs pro-code selection, code hygiene passes, UI and
prose anti-slop, scrub, research and analyst workflows) were informed by the skill library
of AgentX by jnPiyush (https://github.com/jnPiyush/AgentX), licensed under the Apache
License 2.0. That project's NOTICE in turn credits open-design (Apache-2.0), impeccable
(Apache-2.0) and no-ai-slop (MIT) for its design and anti-slop patterns.

No text was copied from those projects. The "dreams" skill has no counterpart there.
Evaluation method and skill-count evidence: SkillsBench, https://www.skillsbench.ai
(arXiv 2602.12670).
